---
description: Implementation workflow (fast UI iterations)
alwaysApply: true
---

Implementation order (do not skip):
1) UI skeleton/layout
2) Local state (useState/useMemo) + typed mock data if needed
3) Loading/empty/error states
4) Spacing/hierarchy polish

Rules:
- Do not connect to Supabase unless explicitly requested.
- Do not introduce global state libraries (no Zustand/Redux).
- Prefer extending existing components over creating new ones.
- Create new files only when clearly justified (reuse first).
- Keep output practical: produce complete code changes (no pseudo-code).

